# Platform delivery

When implementing work that touches **both** the shared seam (`core/` and/or `supabase/`) **and** one or more clients (`apps/android`, `apps/web`, `apps/ios`):

1. Follow the project skill `platform-delivery` (core first → parallel platforms → tests).
2. Honour an explicit user **skip** of a platform or of tests; ask if unclear.
3. Overview: [docs/conventions/agent-dev-environment.md](../../docs/conventions/agent-dev-environment.md).

Single-area edits (only core, only one app, or docs-only) do not require the full fan-out.
